id: MIG-021
ilities: [analysability]
source: cpm
maturity: 3
action: advisory
title: DROP COLUMN in migration
category: quality
severity: warning
engine: pattern
target:
  extensions: .sql .rb .py
  exclude_paths: test/ tests/ .git/ vendor/ node_modules/ seed/
  content_contains: DROP
patterns:
  - regex: (DROP\s+COLUMN|remove_column|RemoveField|DropColumn)
    message: "Dropping column — ensure application code no longer references it (deploy code first)"
fix: Use expand-contract pattern. Deploy code that stops using the column first, then drop it in a later migration.
